{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>It is good to give thanks</b> — in the faith of the heart, and to sing with the mouth and the throat." "<b>To Your name, Most High</b> — for it is exalted above all names. Or: to give thanks with the tongue and to sing with the lyre, and the ten-string [instrument] is my witness."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 92, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:59.208364778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}